      "notes": "The verdict is otherwise well-constructed. The mixed direction is genuinely supported by claims on both sides (construction job potential and connectivity ROI vs. additionality doubts, long delivery horizon, NAO seat-reduction warning, and IFS instability concern). Tier discipline is sound apart from the E20 issue. No lever leakage, party-blind, or magnitude/timing problems detected. Fixing the E20 tier is required before publication but does not change the overall direction or materially alter the rationale."
